# Keeps apps/platform-app/public/ in the repo. The platform-app Dockerfile
# (runner stage) does `COPY --from=builder .../public ./.../public`, so this
# directory must exist in every build context — otherwise the image build fails
# with "/app/apps/platform-app/public: not found". Next.js serves this dir's
# contents as static assets at the web root; it is intentionally empty for now.
